⦿ .spun — the five-fold spin of Brandon
node GQT · GQT · ⟦Brandon:GQT:9e1816⟧

WHO   — Brandon — the superfan who saves the ship
WHAT  — The film's love letter to fandom made literal: the 'wasted' devotion that turns out to be the thing that saves everyone.
WHERE — GQT · Galaxy Quest (1999)  Framework inputs: Galaxy Quest (1999, dir. Dean Parisot, DreamWorks); verified cast & facts  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — Because the movie's quiet thesis is that caring 'too much' about a silly thing is a kind of grace — and Brandon proves it.
HOW   — By knowing every corridor and quirk of a fictional ship so well that, when it's real, his knowledge is the rescue.

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
  Everyone said I wasted my life memorizing a TV show. Then the ship was real, and I was the only one who knew the way out.

